---------
Enhanced DHCP Protection

Summary
=======

Problem:
Attackers could send excessive DHCP requests and exhaust the DHCP address pool.

Solution:
DHCP Snooping Rate Limiting restricts the number of DHCP packets allowed per second on untrusted ports.

Benefit:
Protects DHCP services from starvation and denial-of-service attacks.

Limitation:
Does not identify unauthorized DHCP servers.

